   Modifications by KOOL Robot (CERN-OHL-S section 3.3 notice):
   - K-Bot proportions (1.40 m) are reused as the reference body for a
     motor-less "show v1" robot with hand-posable locking joints
     (Hirth disc + knob, pin + clamp) instead of RobStride actuators.
   - Feet are replaced by sprung wheel feet: one 5" hub drive wheel mounted
     outboard at +/-22 cm and one caster per foot, two die-spring units and
     solenoid locks per foot, and a quick-release leg flange.
   - An "exposed motor" body: RobStride-sized joint housings (dummy housings
     with locking joints in v1) at the K-Bot joint positions, carbon-tube links
     with thin shells, a single central spine and a backpack.
   - A chest bezel for a 7" touchscreen and a new outer shell are added.
   K-Scale repositories without a licence file (kbot-inference,
   kscale-assets) are NOT redistributed here; see their upstream sources.

